B.1 - Smart empty state: detects tech stack from manifest files
  (package.json, go.mod, Cargo.toml, etc.) and shows 3 contextual
  starter prompts on the new session screen; clicks fill the prompt

B.2 - Session branch visual map: forked sessions now render indented
  under their parent in the sidebar with a left border connector,
  using the existing childMapByParent infrastructure

B.3 - Prompt history fuzzy search: Cmd+ArrowUp / Ctrl+ArrowUp opens
  a searchable popover over the prompt input showing filtered history
  entries; arrow keys navigate, Enter fills the prompt, Esc closes

Co-authored-by: CoBuilder CEO <ceo@cobuilder.ai>
